    "51": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 2 rows, 8 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. A small GOLDEN abstract pennant outline and two warm upward radiating arcs. It emerges, glows briefly then fades. Morale increase, no healing cross. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "53": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 2 rows, 8 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. Two sharp ORANGE RED energy prongs rise and unite in a brief bright upward aura, then dissolve. Abstract power, no sword or character. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "57": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 2 rows, 8 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. A GOLD open circular arc spins progressively to complete one ring, gives a small star glint then dissolves. Extra action opportunity, no clock numerals. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "58": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 2 rows, 8 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. A small BLUE GRAY raincloud forms overhead, sends thin BLUE rain streaks beneath, then the casting cloud thins to rain mist. NO lightning or ground impact. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "59": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 2 rows, 8 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. A small BLUE GRAY cloud splits and clears to both sides revealing gentle warm CREAM SUNRAYS, then fades. Weather clearing, no healing cross. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "60": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 2 rows, 8 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. Soft chunky BLUE GRAY cloud puffs gather into one compact dark cloud, swell softly, then fade. No rain no lightning. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "62": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 2 rows, 8 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. A small RED glowing orb contracts into center, transitions into a BLUE magical crystal spark, rises and fades. Red life converted into blue mana, no green healing. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "63": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 2 rows, 8 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. Four SHORT energy lines in restrained ORANGE, BLUEGRAY, TEAL, GOLD light up sequentially then unite into a small gold ring and fade. Never rainbow explosion. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "66": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 3 rows, 12 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. A spectral TORTOISE SHELL with a curling SERPENT silhouette emerges in muted PURPLE BLUE GRAY energy, peaks then dissolves. No individual status symbols; mysterious neutral spirit, not attack. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "67": "Use case: stylized-concept. Transparent pixel-art Korean fantasy tactical RPG VFX spritesheet. EXACTLY 4 columns by 3 rows, 12 equal square cells. Read left-to-right top-to-bottom sequential animation. A WHITE TIGER FACE silhouette with subtle silver stripes emerges in SILVER IVORY with a little JADE energy, peaks then dissolves into gentle falling sparks. No body, no character, no resurrection cross. Sequence starts small, grows, reaches peak around middle, fades to tiny final sparks. Fixed center in every frame; every shape fully within CENTRAL 65 percent of cell with generous transparent margin. Crisp chunky pixel clusters readable at 96px, limited palette, luminous highlight with dark contour like classic tactical RPG. No text, no borders, no grid, no character, no scene, no background. TRUE transparent alpha. Each cell independent with no particles crossing cells. This is a transient spell effect not equipment.",
    "64": "Recreate this azure eastern dragon summoning sprite sheet with the SAME 12 frame animation and same 4 columns 3 rows, but FIX CELL OVERLAP AND CROPPING. Every frame's ENTIRE dragon including all whiskers and wisps must fit well INSIDE the CENTRAL 55 percent of its own equal square cell. No image fragment belonging to a neighboring frame. No clipping at cell edges. Make all dragons considerably smaller relative to the cells. Keep fixed center in every cell, gradual growth then gradual dissolve. Frame6 peak still must fit central55percent. Transparent background, no labels no grid, blue white limited palette pixel art. This is spritesheet editing, preserve 12 frames and 4x3 layout.",
